   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Data Sources\n",
    "\n",
    "This project will use three data sources:\n",
    "\n",
    "- **AI Developer Productivity Dataset (Kaggle):** used to analyze AI usage in relation to coding hours, commits, bugs, and task success.\n",
    "- **Stack Overflow Developer Survey 2025:** used to examine developers’ AI usage, trust, frustrations, perceived productivity, and experience.\n",
    "- **GitHub activity data / GitHub Octoverse:** used to analyze programming languages, AI-related technologies, repositories, and areas receiving increased developer activity.\n",
    "\n",
    "These datasets will not be directly merged. Instead, each dataset will answer a different part of the project question, and the results will be compared together in the final analysis."
   ]
